We adopt a symmetric per-token INT8 quantization scheme that processes the real (xre) and imaginary (xim) components of the activation x independently. For each component, a dynamic scaling factor is computed based on the maximum absolute value within the token’s feature vector. Specifically, the scaling factor for the real part is:
